{
  "date": "2026-11-14",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "工商银行完成中国和泰国之间第一笔“数币达”汇款",
  "title_en": "ICBC completes the first \"Shubida\" remittance between China and Thailand",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月13日，有消息说，中国工商银行重庆市分行和工商银行（泰国）一起，完成了中国和泰国之间第一笔通过“数币达”平台的数字人民币跨境汇款。",
      "en": "On November 13, it was reported that ICBC's Chongqing branch, together with ICBC (Thai), completed the first cross-border digital yuan remittance between China and Thailand made through the \"Shubida\" platform."
    },
    {
      "zh": "数字人民币是中国人民银行发行的数字形式的人民币。“数币达”是一个处理跨境结算的平台，由央行数字货币研究所下面的数字人民币国际运营中心负责。",
      "en": "The digital yuan is a digital form of the renminbi issued by the People's Bank of China. \"Shubida\" is a platform that handles cross-border settlement, run by the Digital Yuan International Operations Center under the central bank's Digital Currency Research Institute."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这次汇款的客户叫陆海新通道运营有限公司。这家公司常常要给国外的合作伙伴付铁路运输的费用。用传统方式结算的时候，钱到得慢，花费也比较高。",
      "en": "The customer for this remittance is called Land-Sea New Corridor Operation Co., Ltd. The company often has to pay railway transport fees to partners abroad. When it settled payments the traditional way, the money arrived slowly and the cost was also fairly high."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这一次，所有的钱都用数字人民币支付，泰国的收款方在同一天就收到了。据介绍，这个平台可以直接清算，不用经过好几层银行。",
      "en": "This time, all of the money was paid in digital yuan, and the payee in Thailand received it on the same day. According to the report, the platform can clear payments directly, without going through several layers of banks."
    }
  ],
